                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f97b0c29-91ae-3be1-be64-6f9ad2467ee7",
                        "entry_id": "45831549-6e19-366c-a2ac-60f7981cc5db",
                        "glosses": [
                            "хим. то же, что шеллак; природная смола, выделяемая самками ряда родов насекомых-червецов семейства Kerriidae, паразитирующими на некоторых тропических и субтропических деревьях"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2dca33aa-d5d4-4571-bf4f-c254b76ddbfd",
                                "sense_id": "f97b0c29-91ae-3be1-be64-6f9ad2467ee7",
                                "text": "Гуммилак (шеллак), по Унфердорбену, переходит отчасти при кипячении щелочных его растворов в маргариновую и олеиновую кислоту."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "88a906de-5d93-4dac-95ca-ad056319b1e4",
                        "source_entry_id": "45831549-6e19-366c-a2ac-60f7981cc5db",
                        "source_sense_id": "f97b0c29-91ae-3be1-be64-6f9ad2467ee7",
                        "target_lang_word": "shellac",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "shellac",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d7b1d995-c69e-31fa-832c-307f1dd2261b",
                                        "entry_id": "e230ffa9-4bc5-3f84-bcc0-e0c664625125",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A processed secretion of the lac insect, Coccus lacca; used in polishes, varnishes etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95a84a1c-7b75-4172-916d-8d0e5e032a24",
                                                "sense_id": "d7b1d995-c69e-31fa-832c-307f1dd2261b",
                                                "text": "But, she says, a wartime ban on recordings using shellac and vinyl kept the Walker version from being released."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9f450b5-0939-416a-8e30-6b7adf2f9a40",
                                                "sense_id": "d7b1d995-c69e-31fa-832c-307f1dd2261b",
                                                "text": "At the turn of the century, the ever-expanding electrical industry was running low on shellac, a resin secreted by the female lac bug which could be used as an insulating material."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "033b7823-f409-3d87-a323-495c2df8e0da",
                                        "entry_id": "e230ffa9-4bc5-3f84-bcc0-e0c664625125",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A beating; a thrashing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "countable",
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "shellac",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e730c2f-0632-3b1b-9635-56bac1ed7986",
